  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is RNA-only scvi_n200 with multiprofile and avgpool aggregation, which has the best validation accuracy and F1. Transformer aggregation was worse than avgpool for PCA, but it has not been tested with the stronger scvi representation. config_006 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer relative to the current best configuration, directly testing whether transformer aggregation can improve the top RNA-only model. This is a high-value next step because it exploits the most promising direction while isolating an important design choice, and it avoids prematurely testing more complex multimodal fusion before clarifying aggregation behavior."
